                        // THE FIGHT'S OWN LOOK BANK (javap `WardenAi
                        // .initFightActivity` pc 23-37 + `SetEntityLook
                        // Target.lambda$create$5` — the FIGHT list's own
                        // index-2 the OneShot wears: the `isTarget` pred
