                // THE GROWTH'S OWN WORD (the record + the registration +
                // the place sound — javap attemptUseCharge pc 148-177:
                // the setBlock(above, state, 3) the flag-3 walk wears,
                // the playSound(null, cursorPos, placeSound, BLOCKS,
