    /// nextFloat * 0.25` tint scale, the spawn `(anchor + d2*0.1,
    /// +0.3, + d4*0.1)` the cos/sin folds place, the color `(r*f, g*f,
    /// b*f)` the option carries — the ctor chain the spell helper
