    /// PrimedTnt at (x+0.5, y, z+0.5) the addFreshEntity wears, the
    /// `playSound(null, ..., TNT_PRIMED, BLOCKS, 1.0F, 1.0F)` the
    /// fconst pair speaks, the `setBlock(pos, AIR, 11)` the tail
